  accTitle: The House system map
  accDescr: Owners manage stable agent profiles and revisions. The API runs the House and agents through the engine. Accepted facts and explanatory evidence are stored separately, projected into read models, and delivered through web, MCP, and producer interfaces.

  WebControl["Web dashboard"] --> Profile["Stable Agent Profile"]
  McpControl["Scoped MCP management"] --> Profile
  Profile --> Revision["Frozen Analytical Revision"]
  Revision --> Runtime["API lifecycle, House controller, agent instances, and deterministic engine"]

  Runtime --> Events["Canonical event log"]
  Runtime --> Transcript["Transcript"]
  Runtime --> Cognition["Cognitive artifacts"]
  Runtime --> Trace["Private trace evidence"]

  Events --> Reads["Governed projections, policies, and read models"]
  Transcript --> Reads
  Cognition --> Reads
  Trace --> Reads

  Reads --> Delivery["REST, viewer-safe WebSocket, and scoped Production MCP"]
  Delivery --> Viewer["Web viewers"]
  Delivery --> Hosts["Connected AI hosts"]
  Delivery --> Tools["Producer tools"]

